404
00:22:58,860 --> 00:23:00,130
That being said...

405
00:23:00,130 --> 00:23:04,980
Will we see the day when Mr. Hitoma 
makes Tobari Haneda graduate?

406
00:23:04,980 --> 00:23:06,890
Who can say?

407
00:23:06,890 --> 00:23:09,350
Do you think I can manage to graduate?

408
00:23:09,820 --> 00:23:13,460
You show no interest in 
graduating, Lady Shiranui.

409
00:23:13,910 --> 00:23:17,730
And we'd be 
in a lot of trouble if you did.

410
00:23:17,730 --> 00:23:19,670
I know that.

411
00:23:23,950 --> 00:23:26,660
What will the next year bring?

412
00:23:28,740 --> 00:23:29,770
Mr. Hitoma.

413
00:23:31,150 --> 00:23:35,060
Teach me more about being human.

